  "description": "Source same-side and opposite-side plane diagrams. Panel b has the actual spatial intersection O on A-B, with solid AO, hidden dashed continuation and solid continuation to B; screen crossings of the finite plane patch add no spatial points. Representative projection and visibility-break location are modern display choices only.",
